# ============================================================================
# SYNTHETIC FIXTURE - NOT a recorded device session.
# Hand-written to exercise scripts/evaluate-live-session.py. No device, model or
# throughput claim rests on this file. Its EVIDENCE requirement fails on purpose,
# which is what stops any fixture in this directory from ever exiting 0.
#
# Fixture intent: the POSITIVE CONTROL. ~0.58 depth updates/s, 97% of offered
# frames dropped as busy, no discarded frames, no errors, camera Streaming, and
# a reported fps that matches inferences/elapsedS on every line.
# Expected: UPDATES/PROGRESS/DROPS/TOO_SMALL/ERRORS/SELF_CONSISTENCY/SPAN/CAMERA
# all PASS, EVIDENCE FAIL (synthetic) => OVERALL FAIL, exit 1.
# Without this control every other fixture would prove nothing.
#
# Field values are modelled on the real captured output of LiveDepthPipeline.kt
# (backend=CPU, the known fallback in HANDOVER 2.4), not on any captured logcat:
# the numbers are internally consistent but invented.
# ============================================================================
